      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "2008 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "The treatment of hemorrhagic complications of percutaneous interventions with protamine is an accepted practice. Concerns exist about the increased thrombo-genicity of drug-eluting stents. We report two cases of acute stent thrombosis following drug-eluting stent implantation related to protamine administration."
